{#
    Home page.

    Composition follows the reference template's own home page, in its order:
    hero, selected engagements, the numbered offer, the method panel, questions,
    reviews, then the closing call to action. The programme catalogue sits
    between the offer and the method panel so the seven programmes stay one
    scroll from the fold rather than behind a navigation click.

    Every section is optional. Each partial tests for its own block or rows and
    renders nothing when they are absent, so an editor can take any section
    offline from the admin without leaving a gap or a heading with no content.
    No visitor-facing string is held in this template.
#}
{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}{{ blocks['home.hero'].heading|default('Global Dynamics Consulting') }}{% endblock %}

{% block description %}{{ blocks['home.hero'].body|default('Project management certification, tool mastery and enterprise strategy consulting in Dar es Salaam.')|striptags|slice(0, 155) }}{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
    {% include '_partials/_home_hero.html.twig' with {blocks: blocks, items: items} only %}
    {% include '_partials/_home_work.html.twig' with {blocks: blocks, items: items} only %}
    {% include '_partials/_home_services.html.twig' with {blocks: blocks, items: items} only %}
    {% include '_partials/_home_catalogue.html.twig' with {blocks: blocks, pillars: pillars, grouped: grouped, totalServices: totalServices} only %}
    {% include '_partials/_home_method.html.twig' with {blocks: blocks, items: items} only %}
    {% include '_partials/_home_faq.html.twig' with {blocks: blocks, items: items} only %}
    {% include '_partials/_home_reviews.html.twig' with {blocks: blocks, items: items} only %}
    {% include '_partials/_home_cta.html.twig' with {blocks: blocks, items: items} only %}
{% endblock %}
